The single ingestion path rejects before canonical mutation:
- malformed JSON;
- truncated JSON;
- Markdown-wrapped JSON;
- oversized JSON;
- duplicate member names;
- unsafe smart or curly quotation output;
- wrong root type;
- unknown closed properties;
- wrong job;
